      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلْحَبٌ</span></b>  <i>Anything with which a thing is cut</i> or
<i>peeled:</i> (S, K:) <i>cutting,</i> or <i>sharp, iron.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A great reviler,</i> or <i>vilifier, of obscene
tongue.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A chaste,</i> or <i>an eloquent,
